{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼好险好险。\\n　急死我了，我还以为赶不上了……」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": "「呼好险好险。　急死我了，我还以为赶不上了……」", "plain_idx": 140, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4591", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你提前跟我说一句的话我就去家里接你了」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "12月31日，除夕。", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听说纱凪父亲也回家了，所以我们没法见面。", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "听说纱凪父亲也回家了，所以我们没法见面。", "plain_idx": 144, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，距离跨年还差30分钟的时候她打了电话过来。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说是现在来见我。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打完电话后，我就在公园等着。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "年末再次降下的雪，将公园染得一片洁白。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾没关系吗？\\n　 我这样打电话叫你出来也挺突然的……」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": "「新吾没关系吗？　 我这样打电话叫你出来也挺突然的……」", "plain_idx": 150, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4592", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我每年都是在家慢悠悠地跨年，所以没关系啦」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小樱呢？」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4593", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和濑名同学一起去新年参拜，\\n　然后去购物广场玩了」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "「和濑名同学一起去新年参拜，　然后去购物广场玩了」", "plain_idx": 156, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊。 那哥哥你本来是要独自一人跨年吗」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": "「这样啊。 那哥哥你本来是要独自一人跨年吗」", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4594", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪牵起我的手，深呼吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她应该是跑过来的吧。", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那双没带手套的手已经冰凉了。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪没关系吗？\\n　你爸爸不是难得回来一次吗……」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": "「纱凪没关系吗？　你爸爸不是难得回来一次吗……」", "plain_idx": 163, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我本来也是想和家人一起跨年的啦。\\n　都是理央吵着要我出去」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「我本来也是想和家人一起跨年的啦。　都是理央吵着要我出去」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4595", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是为我们两个着想的吗」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是那样，也希望他挑温柔点的方式啊……」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4596", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，今年也马上要结束了呢」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4597", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，确实是呢」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看了眼时间，今年也就只剩下一分钟了。", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今年也受了你很多照顾呢」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才是，多谢有你关照」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人各自低头示意，然后十指相扣。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明年会是怎样的呢」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，真期待啊」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……希望是个好年头啊」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们一同仰望星空，等待着那个瞬间。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「五」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4601", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「四」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「三」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4602", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「二」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一！」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4603", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和纱凪相遇的这一年，转眼之间就过去了。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，我们两人迎来了新的一年。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新年快乐——！\\n　今年、明年还有后年，从今往后都请多指教」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": "「新年快乐——！　今年、明年还有后年，从今往后都请多指教」", "plain_idx": 195, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4604", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，新年快乐。今年也请多多指教啦」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和喜欢的女生一起迎来的新年让我感觉好像过去的每一个新年都黯淡无光似的。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "和喜欢的女生一起迎来的新年让我感觉好像过去的每一个新年都黯淡无光似的。", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一幕，在我眼中无比耀眼。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦，机会难得，我们这就去新年参拜吧？」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6831", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以是可以啦……\\n　可回家晚了你爸不会担心吗？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「可以是可以啦……　可回家晚了你爸不会担心吗？」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有跟他说可能会去参拜，\\n　所以一个小时左右应该没有关系」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「我有跟他说可能会去参拜，　所以一个小时左右应该没有关系」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6832", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯？新吾，你是想和我多待一会吗？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「……嗯？新吾，你是想和我多待一会吗？」", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6833", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、没有……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬之间脑海中闪过平安夜的经历。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……虽然确实是想和你多待一会，\\n　但是我们还是得顾着点家里人」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "「……虽然确实是想和你多待一会，　但是我们还是得顾着点家里人」", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立马摆出防御态势。\\n大过年的，我可不想吃苦头。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "我立马摆出防御态势。大过年的，我可不想吃苦头。", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊说的也是呢，虽然有些店过年也会开，\\n　但是新吾没办法抛下家里人一个人四处玩乐呢」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「啊说的也是呢，虽然有些店过年也会开，　但是新吾没办法抛下家里人一个人四处玩乐呢」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6834", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那就这先这样，去新年参拜吧。\\n　逛个小摊的时间还是有的吧？」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「嗯，那就这先这样，去新年参拜吧。　逛个小摊的时间还是有的吧？」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6835", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然，那也是新年参拜的乐趣之一呢」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着带着笑容缠上我胳膊的纱凪，\\n也回以笑脸，开始向前走。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "我看着带着笑容缠上我胳膊的纱凪，也回以笑脸，开始向前走。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后到了附近的神社。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "神社里很多人，已经热闹起来了，\\n但幸运的是，我们没等多久就到了投币箱前。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "神社里很多人，已经热闹起来了，但幸运的是，我们没等多久就到了投币箱前。", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两并肩而立，投钱入箱，然后一起行礼参拜。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我许的愿当然是，希望今后能和纱凪一直在一起。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "我许的愿当然是，希望今后能和纱凪一直在一起。", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然这愿望有不少内涵，\\n但神明大人一定能理解我的吧。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "……虽然这愿望有不少内涵，但神明大人一定能理解我的吧。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——就要回去了啊～……真是太快了」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6836", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚转完小摊回到公园，\\n纱凪就满怀遗憾地嘀咕道。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "刚转完小摊回到公园，纱凪就满怀遗憾地嘀咕道。", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "时间就正好，是之前说的一个小时。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，纱凪会这样，也不是不能理解。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过也是，第一次就这样吧」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6837", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……什么意思？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为这又不是最后一次，\\n　之后机会还有的是……」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「因为这又不是最后一次，　之后机会还有的是……」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6838", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要以后每年都，一点一点增加在一起的时间就好了」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「只要以后每年都，一点一点增加在一起的时间就好了」", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6839", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……和我吗？」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那还能是和谁啊？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6840", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，我不是那个意思——」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「啊，我不是那个意思——」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～这么想来，又开始期待明年了啊。\\n　干脆去爬山看个新年日出怎么样？我这样会不会太过分？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "「啊～这么想来，又开始期待明年了啊。　干脆去爬山看个新年日出怎么样？我这样会不会太过分？」", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6841", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，不管怎样，我都很期待未来～」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6842", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪畅想着未来，开心地笑了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——她构想出来的未来，\\n我自然地就在她身边。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "——她构想出来的未来，我自然地就在她身边。", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这件事，或许都没必要求神了。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6843", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呀……嗯」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、呜哇！你都笑得合不拢嘴了」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6844", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……听我说，纱凪」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6845", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我爱你」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6846", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是。\\n　最喜欢你了，新吾」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「我也是。　最喜欢你了，新吾」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6847", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「————」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「————」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……啊啊，太厉害了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来是这样啊。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，你别惹得我也开笑了啊，\\n　你这就把我的新年初笑夺走了啦」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「哎，你别惹得我也开笑了啊，　你这就把我的新年初笑夺走了啦」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6848", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跨年的时候你不是笑过了吗？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这么一说好像有道理啊」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6849", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘛，无所谓啦，反正是新吾干的，都好♪」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6850", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那么，今年也请多多关照了」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6851", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新年的一切，都是那么绚丽夺目。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪的笑脸，比任何事物都要耀眼。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯。今年我也会好好守护你的。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "携手共进吧。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
